# Even and odd supermodes; the power crosses over in lambda / (2 (n_even - n_odd)). The splitting falls exponentially with the gap.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy.
title Two 450 x 220 nm strips, 300 nm apart, quasi-TE
grid dx=0.025 dy=0.02
window width=4.0 ymin=-1.0 ymax=1.22
rect si 0.15 0.6 0 0.22
rect si -0.6 -0.15 0 0.22
field te
coupler
expect n_even 2.423856032 2e-8
expect n_odd 2.409611186 2e-8
expect splitting 0.014244846 1e-4
expect coupling_length 54.405643387 1e-4
expect guided yes
expect cells 8880
